  "releaseNotes": "Fixes a startup crash. Upgrading from 17.0.0 is strongly recommended.\n\n- Fixed: the site failed to start with \"Invalid object name 'umbElementFinderState'\" on installations where the package migration had not run. Element Finder now detects that its tables are missing, logs a warning, and lets the site start normally.\n- Fixed: saving content no longer throws when the Element Finder tables are missing.\n- Fixed: the dashboard now reports zero usage instead of failing when the index is not yet available.",
